Dialogue: 1,0:03:28.49,0:03:34.00,Signs,,0,0,0,,{\fad(520,520)\blur1.8\1a&H4C&\c&H000000&\pos(964.5,147)}December 7th, 2025\N— In GGO{\fnKozuka Mincho Pro Strp}・{\fn}Wasteland Field —
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.25,0:03:53.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yo, Dyne.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.87,0:03:55.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You sure you got the right info?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.87,0:03:57.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They coming or what?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.31,0:03:59.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're coming, all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.99,0:04:02.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I checked the route myself. So relax.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.17,0:04:08.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I bet they're busy clearing\Nsome big-ass monster spawn.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.73,0:04:10.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That means your cut will\Nbe bigger this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.01,0:04:12.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So no complaining.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.65,0:04:14.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dude, no one's complaining.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.51,0:04:18.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Since we're talking about it, ain't\Nthese the same jokers we hit last week?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.29,0:04:20.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They could have wised up to\Nus and changed their route.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.07,0:04:23.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All that squad does is hunt monsters.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.63,0:04:25.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They don't care how many\Ntimes they get attacked
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.55,0:04:28.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,because they'll just make up\Nfor it on their next hunt.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.19,0:04:31.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For player-hunter squads like\Nus, they make the perfect target.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.97,0:04:34.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They move by algorithm,\Njust like the monsters.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.99,0:04:37.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As far as I'm concerned, they're chumps.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.31,0:04:38.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn straight.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.65,0:04:39.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As for weapons,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.83,0:04:43.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,they're geared up with optical\Nguns for hunting monsters but we've
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.09,0:04:46.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,got defense shields so as long as\Nthose are up it's easy pickings.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.59,0:04:50.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well what if they got smart like what\Nif they're ready for us this time
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.57,0:04:54.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we hit them not too long ago right i\Ndoubt they got their hands on enough
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.29,0:04:58.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,live ammo guns that fast by now they\Nmight have one firearm for support
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.57,0:05:04.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but that's about it and besides we got\Nthe best sniper in ggo watching our
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.95,0:05:13.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Backs. We've got all our bases.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.97,0:05:19.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,covered right Sinon yep guess
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.59,0:05:22.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,i can't argue with that with\Na crack shot like Sinon up
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.87,0:05:28.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,here things are looking good\Nit's better than good well
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.33,0:05:32.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,if it's a big if but still if\Nshe missed i'd be cool with.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.17,0:05:34.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,that.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.08,0:05:36.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It'll take them about a minute to\Nfigure out where the shot came from.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.89,0:05:38.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,While they're doing
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.53,0:05:41.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,that, I'll be in position.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.97,0:05:44.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll hose them down and rake in the money.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.27,0:05:45.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Easy, cowboy.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.77,0:05:46.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, doll face.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.11,0:05:49.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was wondering, what\Nyou doing after this?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.71,0:05:52.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I found a gunshot with\Nan awesome inventory.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.49,0:05:56.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe we could go get some tea\Nor maybe do something else.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.21,0:05:57.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know what I mean.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.05,0:06:03.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know what you mean, January.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.57,0:06:06.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Besides, there's stuff I\Nhave to do when I log out.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.09,0:06:08.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, come on, dollface. What's the stuff?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.93,0:06:10.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, are you still in school?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.57,0:06:11.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, that's kind of hot.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.79,0:06:13.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You got a report, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.27,0:06:14.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.13,0:06:16.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lay off her, January.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.55,0:06:18.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't put her on the spot like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.33,0:06:21.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're working, so don't\Nbring up the real world here.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.21,0:06:22.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.19,0:06:25.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This ain't the time or place\Nto respect your solo status.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.17,0:06:26.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Like, you guys could talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.99,0:06:29.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When's the last time\Neither of you got lucky?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.35,0:06:31.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Last night with your sister.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.73,0:06:35.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Knock it off. Stay sharp. Got him.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.89,0:06:41.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,About time they showed up to the party.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.87,0:06:46.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yep, it's them.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.25,0:06:50.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One, two, three, four, five, six, seven.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.71,0:06:52.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's one more than last week.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.23,0:07:04.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We got four optical blasters in the front.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.17,0:07:09.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I see one large caliber laser rifle.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.57,0:07:10.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not a problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.87,0:07:12.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.78,0:07:13.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,a guy with a mini-me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.23,0:07:15.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He goes down first.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.95,0:07:20.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The new guy in the back.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.65,0:07:21.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's got a cloak on.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.07,0:07:23.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can't see what he's carrying.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.89,0:07:25.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's wearing a cloak? Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.43,0:07:29.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe it's him, that Death Gun\Nguy everyone's talking about.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.13,0:07:31.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh, no way.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.55,0:07:33.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What, you believe in fairy tales now?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.27,0:07:38.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He looks like he's strength-filled,\Nprobably just a courier, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.09,0:07:42.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If anything, I bet he's carrying the\Nsquad's ammo, energy packs, and drops.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.67,0:07:43.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Eh, we can ignore him.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.31,0:07:51.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm getting a bad vibe\Nfrom the guy in back.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.07,0:07:55.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think we should take him out\Nbefore anyone else. No way.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.09,0:07:57.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's not carrying any weapons.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.87,0:07:59.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe he is, maybe he isn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.87,0:08:01.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's an unknown, so he's a risk.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.03,0:08:03.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hear what you're saying,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.31,0:08:05.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but there's also a mini-me out\Nthere, and that's a problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.03,0:08:10.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If he starts lighting us up and those\Nblasters move in, it's gonna get ugly.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.81,0:08:11.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Understood.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.72,0:08:13.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll drop the guy with the mini-me first.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.03,0:08:15.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But my second bullet's got Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.11,0:08:17.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Cloak's name on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.53,0:08:20.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hate to interrupt you guys,\Nbut they're closing on us.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.23,0:08:21.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're at 2,500 meters.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.21,0:08:23.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.12,0:08:24.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're going to stick\Nwith the original plan
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.57,0:08:27.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and wait for him in the\Nshadow of that building.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.17,0:08:29.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sinon, call out if the situation changes.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.15,0:08:31.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait for my order to fire.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.31,0:08:33.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Roger.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.33,0:08:34.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.24,0:08:35.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Move out.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.69,0:09:16.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm in position. Roger.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.13,0:09:20.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Targets haven't changed\Ntheir course or their speed.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.37,0:09:24.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're 400 meters from you,\N1,500 from me. Pretty far.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.61,0:09:28.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can you make the shot? No sweat.\NOkay, then. Fire when ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.01,0:09:31.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm counting on you, Gunner. Roger.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.79,0:09:37.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This pressure.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.89,0:09:40.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This anxiety.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.03,0:09:42.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This fear.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.17,0:09:44.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,1,500 meters.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.33,0:09:49.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's nothing like tossing a\Nwad of paper into a trash can.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.57,0:09:51.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No way.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.61,0:09:54.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is nothing like how it felt that day.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.75,0:10:07.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Next!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.49,0:10:21.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can't change position.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.67,0:10:27.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I cleared the first target, but\NI couldn't pop the second one.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.23,0:10:29.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Roger that.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.35,0:10:31.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sit tight up there, you hear?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.19,0:10:32.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go, go, go!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.61,0:10:59.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's got a minigun!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.15,0:11:03.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're not late because\Ntheir hunt was running long.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.73,0:11:05.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're moving slow in\Nthe field because the
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.79,0:11:08.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,weight of that minigun's\Ngot a movement penalty.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.61,0:11:45.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I knew it. This op's\Ngoing to be a cakewalk.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.79,0:11:50.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gah!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.19,0:12:15.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.39,0:12:20.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If he can smile in the middle of a\Nfirefight, He must be pretty brave.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.61,0:12:23.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.47,0:12:28.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Either way, he's mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.25,0:12:40.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Duck!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.69,0:12:43.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Crap!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.60,0:12:44.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't let him get closer!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.55,0:12:45.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.46,0:12:46.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Roger that!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.91,0:13:00.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gotta find some cover. But where?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.31,0:13:03.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where? Damn it. Where?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.93,0:13:07.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sinon?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.75,0:13:29.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Xenon, are you hit?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.59,0:13:34.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bastards.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.27,0:13:38.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They teamed up with a freaking bodyguard.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.91,0:13:40.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bodyguard?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.99,0:13:43.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's that guy with the minigun.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.37,0:13:46.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's a macho prick,\Ncalls himself behemoth.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.13,0:13:49.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, we can't keep sitting here\Nbecause they're going to wipe us out.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.01,0:13:52.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That minigun's only got\Nso much ammo to fire.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.01,0:13:57.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If we attack him at once, he'll panic\Nand burn through the rest of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.63,0:13:59.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jin and Miss, you take the left flank.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.73,0:14:01.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dyne and I will come in from the right.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.75,0:14:03.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Arashi, you stay here and cover us.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.75,0:14:04.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.23,0:14:08.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What about the three guys out\Nthere carrying the blasters?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.39,0:14:10.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even if we rush them, our\Ndefense shields aren't enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.97,0:14:14.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right, but their blasters can't\Nfire as fast as a live ammo gun.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.47,0:14:15.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We can just dodge them.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.67,0:14:16.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Screw that!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.58,0:14:20.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If we go charging out there, that\Nminigun will turn us into confetti!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.19,0:14:25.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry, but we're packing it in.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.25,0:14:27.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's better if we log out right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.47,0:14:29.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,At least we'll be able to get away.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.59,0:14:32.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We don't get away from\Nthings by logging out.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.21,0:14:34.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you nuts?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.33,0:14:35.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is a game, for Christ's sakes!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.01,0:14:36.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Think about it!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.92,0:14:38.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even if we charge them, we just die!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.53,0:14:39.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then die!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.75,0:14:42.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It is a game,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.66,0:14:46.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so you can at least have the balls to\Nface death here instead of whining.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.79,0:14:53.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We can do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.37,0:14:58.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you can distract a minigun for three\Nseconds, I can take him out. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.35,0:15:00.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.26,0:15:02.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then we'll split up and\Nattack him from both sides.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.39,0:15:03.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Got it? Got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.19,0:15:20.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.25,0:15:34.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dive! Cover me!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.09,0:16:03.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How do you like that, punk?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.81,0:16:32.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Screw you!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.61,0:16:56.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nice going.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.41,0:17:02.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, I've got to figure out how\Nto get into Behemoth's blind spot.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.59,0:17:09.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I better move fast, or he's\Ngonna get a beat on my location.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.53,0:17:18.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bullets are flying, and he's\Ngot the guts to smile like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.21,0:17:23.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe I will, too, when I kill him.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.85,0:17:44.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Doclip! Ugh!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.45,0:17:55.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hahahahahahahaha!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.17,0:18:21.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.31,0:18:57.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.39,0:19:15.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I love you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.21,0:19:42.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.71,0:19:46.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I gotta get stronger.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.55,0:20:01.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.29,0:20:04.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ha-ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.75,0:20:07.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've got a new trick up my sleeve!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.93,0:20:10.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Help!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.09,0:20:17.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please all help me!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.05,0:20:18.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.85,0:20:22.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lisbeth!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.61,0:20:41.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's see what we got.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.87,0:20:45.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please tell me that's the last of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.75,0:20:48.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm, I think I pretty much\Ngot everything I need now.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.61,0:20:49.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You want to keep going some more?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.01,0:20:53.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You always hook us up at your shop, so\Nif you need more, we don't mind helping.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.95,0:20:54.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.03,0:21:00.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Although, hmm, we sort of picked\Nthis place clean, didn't we?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.47,0:21:02.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's take a break and let him respawn.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.67,0:21:03.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.41,0:21:10.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're so into each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.85,0:21:13.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's not fair, damn it. Now, now.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.97,0:21:17.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It doesn't matter if\Nthey're at school or here.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.13,0:21:19.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They can't keep their\Nhands off each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.15,0:21:21.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You mean they're like this at school, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.73,0:21:23.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All day, every day.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.03,0:21:24.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.09,0:21:54.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.69,0:22:03.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Asuna, there's something important\NI've been wanting to tell you.
